Agent: The cache holds at most 64 decoded buffers (MAX_AUDIO_BUFFER_ENTRIES) and evicts the least-recently-used entry that isn't pinned or live-referenced. "Live" comes from readLiveAudioBufferReferences, which the composition root fills with the ids the open arrangement references. A buffer that only an undo or redo entry names is neither, so after 64 other writes it's evictable, and when undo restores the clip nothing reloads the decoded buffer.

